, 0, 0}: I don’t want to\\nunderstand you!\\rI will never become someone like you.\\rA coward when you’re alone and\\nacting like a tyrant when you’re in\\ffront of other cowards!\\rI will become strong!\\rI will become a stronger man all\\nby myself!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00006":"{SIZE 200}All by myself!{SIZE 100}\\r","msg_0360_R22_00007":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...What are you\\nstaring at?\\r","msg_0360_R22_00008":"..................\\rOne must acknowledge one’s defeat\\nbefore he can move on...\\rI will go solo...for now...\\rSo that one day I will form\\na stronger organization!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00009":"Putting together the potential of many\\nis how you produce a huge power...\\fThat’s what an organization is...\\rThat’s the strength of\\nan organization!\\rI failed...to make the best use of\\nmy subordinates’ potential...!\\rBut you shall witness one day\\nthe revival of me and my {COLOR 1}Team Rocket{COLOR 0}!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00010":"..................\\nOne day, you will understand.\\r","msg_0360_R22_00011":"Ethan: Where are we...?\\r","msg_0360_R22_00012":"Lyra: Where are we...?\\r","msg_0360_R22_00013":"Ethan: Ilex Forest has disappeared!\\r...That’s not it.\\nIt’s more like we have been\\ftransported somewhere else...?\\r","msg_0360_R22_00014":"Lyra: Ilex Forest has disappeared!\\r...That’s not it.\\nIt’s more like we have been\\ftransported somewhere else...?\\r","msg_0360_R22_00015":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, something is strange!\\rI heard the radio mentioning\\nthe date from three years ago!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00016":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, something is strange!\\rI heard the radio mentioning\\nthe date from three years ago!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00017":"Is that...am I looking at...\\nCELEBI?\\rThat explains it!\\nCELEBI must have caused all this!\\rMy grandpa once told me that\\nCELEBI can travel through time using\\fits mystic power called {COLOR 1}Time Travel{COLOR 0}!\\rCELEBI must have taken us back in time!\\nLiterally!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00018":"Is that...am I looking at...\\nCELEBI?\\rThat explains it!\\nCELEBI must have caused all this!\\rMy grandpa once told me that\\nCELEBI can travel through time using\\fits mystic power called {COLOR 1}Time Travel{COLOR 0}!\\rCELEBI must have taken us back in time!\\nLiterally!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00019":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, there is someone else\\nhere besides us! Let’s go find out who!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00020":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, there is someone else\\nhere besides us! Let’s go find out who!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00021":"Ethan: Who does he think he is?\\nThat was unnecessary!\\rBut what were they talking about?\\nThe revival of {COLOR 1}Team Rocket{COLOR 0}...?\\rThey say that Team Rocket was\\nremoved from the Kanto region\\fby a child three years ago.\\rSo this really is three years ago!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00022":"Lyra: Who does he think he is?\\nThat was unnecessary!\\rBut what were they talking about?\\nThe revival of {COLOR 1}Team Rocket{COLOR 0}...?\\rThey say that Team Rocket was\\nremoved from the Kanto region\\fby a child three years ago.\\rSo this really is three years ago!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00023":"Oh no! It’s happening again...!\\rIt’s CELEBI’s {COLOR 1}Time Travel{COLOR 0}!\\r","msg_0360_R22_00024":"Oh no! It’s happening again...!\\rIt’s CELEBI’s {COLOR 1}Time Travel{COLOR 0}!\\r"},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_UNK_40FE","value":1,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_R22_003 + 1"}],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_R22_001 + 1","OnResume":"_EV_scr_seq_R22_004 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_R22_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_R22_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_R22_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_R22_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_R22_004":4,"obj_R22_gsmiddleman1":0,"obj_R22_sakaki":1,"obj_R22_gsrivel":2,"obj_R22_var_1":3}}
